Subject: [PATCH 3/6] x86/ticketlock: Use C for __ticket_spin_unlock
Date: Mon, 24 Jan 2011 15:41:16 -0800
Message-Id: <8cc17932f623d3e65efb0b5e223537a28cc566e7.1295909909.git.jeremy.fitzhardinge@citrix.com>
